{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 88335, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 61720, "uid": 42813, "type": 4, "title": "未来可能实装的raid前瞻", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1631616941, "updated_at": 1632207400, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1632207400, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 11, "status": 1, "summary": "不定期更新。主要就是放点日服raid的资料，再加上个人的一些简评。21期-INFERNO-暗raidboss技能：翻译：对策技能：翻译：点火相关：简评：boss比较菜，对策也菜，极限伤害比不过婚巴，相", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618283775_3755667.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618281097_40102819.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618277404_61043199.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 11, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 27807, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 88335, "content": "不定期更新。<div>主要就是放点日服raid的资料，再加上个人的一些简评。</div><div><br><div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;\">21期 -</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">INFERNO</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;\">- 暗raid</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">boss技能：</span><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631617897316_79368669.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631617897316_79368669.jpg\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 230px;\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">翻译：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">对策技能：</div></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631617906401_78484094.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631617906401_78484094.jpg\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 1015px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">翻译：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">点火相关：</div><br></span></div>简评：boss比较菜，对策也菜，极限伤害比不过婚巴，相比普巴①伤害高一点点②后续容易高加。</span></div>\n                               </div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">22期 -<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">Knight of Rose</span>- 木raid</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">boss技能：<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618084145_72125620.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618084145_72125620.jpg\"></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">翻译：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">对策技能：<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618107123_84077633.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618107123_84077633.jpg\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 1477px;\"></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">翻译：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">点火相关：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">简评：boss技能组很强，但是对策技能组更强，在火人鱼+对策面前boss就像婴儿一样无力，最麻烦的应该是全技能防御+60%以及队伍奶妈的问题。另外木莫娜几乎完全被对策上位替代了，可以说木莫娜在木raid已经退役。</span><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">23期 -<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">WOUNDED WINNER PART.1</span>- 火raid</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">boss技能：<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618153888_60830089.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618153888_60830089.jpg\"></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">翻译：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">对策技能：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618009655_94351653.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618009655_94351653.jpg\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 1426px;\"></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">翻译：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">点火相关：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">简评：boss技能组很强，对策技能虽然也很强力但相比22期有所收敛，比较吃点火，低加且不点火可以考虑不上场。这期比较需要水罗刹上场。高加高点火对策可以一个顶木莫娜+雷欧两个，这种情况下<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">可以说木莫娜和雷欧在火raid已经退役。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">不过有无敌的青钢影想斩车还是很容易的，用老一套阵容都没问题。</span></span></span><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;\">24期 -</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">WOUNDED WINNER PART.2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;\">- 光raid</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">boss技能：<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618182404_27721732.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618182404_27721732.jpg\"></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">翻译：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">对策技能：<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618201950_88888966.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618201950_88888966.jpg\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 1358px;\"></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">翻译：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">点火相关：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">简评：boss应该是洛基吧，给我的印象是幕后大boss，不过技能组确实华丽，伤害妨碍防御啥都有，具体的到时候再看。对策刀应该是伊芙，也是老朋友了，作为对策刀来说性能非常优秀，高配置下应该能超越暗提裙。</span><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">25期&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;\">-</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">WOUNDED WINNER PART.3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;\">- 水raid</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">boss技能：<div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618235170_77578261.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618235170_77578261.jpg\"></div><br></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">翻译：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">对策技能：<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618277404_61043199.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618277404_61043199.jpg\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 365px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618281097_40102819.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618281097_40102819.jpg\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 363px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618283775_3755667.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618283775_3755667.jpg\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 367px;\"></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">翻译：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">点火相关：</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">简评：感觉boss伤害会很高，需要注意。对策怎么是刀啊？raid辅助里就木系最拉，专属双刃剑也没有，专属应援也没有，出了个白猫集中拐太超模了不敢出了是吧？日服倒是无所谓，国际服到时候大部分人用的怕不是还是现在这期的阵容。话说回来，这对策强度还行，出了后应该是raid最强木刀。</span><br></div></div>\n                               </div></div></div></div></div><div><br></div><div>萌新请仔细阅读<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/22652.html\" target=\"_blank\">raid入门</a>，机制都讲的很清楚了。</div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container active-item\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">关于科学斩史</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">1.买个云机，具体哪家区别不大。（不建议用自己手机，寿命消耗太快）<div>2.云机里各种工具装好，什么谷歌、魔法（自己解决，应该都装过一次知道流程，云机里再来一次就行）、脚本（网站群里免费）</div><div>3.设置好脚本（有教程）</div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618283775_3755667.jpg", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1631618281097_40102819.jpg", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/